---
title: "claim_reward_as_coin (Pebble Protocol: Liquidity Mining)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate_market(market)
    q_validate --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_circuit_break: check circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_error_cb: circuit_break triggered
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_get_miner: miner = market.borrow_liquidity_mining_mut()
    q_get_miner --> q_claim: claimed = miner.claim_rewards(reward_type, obligation_id, clock, reward_index)
    q_claim --> q_emit: emit RewardClaimedEvent
    q_emit --> q_to_coin: claimed_reward.into_coin(ctx)
    q_to_coin --> [*]: return Coin

    note right of q_claim
        INV-001: reward_type distinguishes deposit vs borrow rewards
        INV-002: reward_index specifies which reward pool to claim from
        INV-003: only obligation owner can claim (enforced by obligation_owner_cap)
    end note
